      "id": "math",
      "kind": "derivation",
      "title": "配對機率、loss與購買數量的透明推導",
      "verified": true,
      "details": "p=exp(c)/(exp(c)+exp(r))=1/(1+exp(-(c-r)))。L=-log(p)=log(1+exp(-d))；dL/dd=-1/(1+exp(d))<0。d=0得p=0.5、L=ln2=0.6931471805599453；d=2得p=0.8807970779778823、L=0.1269280110429725；d=-1得p=0.2689414213699951；d=1得p=0.7310585786300049。同加10時(c+10)-(r+10)=c-r。單價1元、固定運費2元：T=1*n+2；n=1得3元，n=2得4元，故未給n不能唯一決定T。"
    },
